// Windows resource script for the tray GUI binary.
//
// Resource id 1 matters twice over:
//   * Explorer, the taskbar and Alt-Tab show the lowest-numbered RT_GROUP_ICON
//     as the executable's icon, and gpui registers its window class with a null
//     hIcon, so this is what the window inherits.
//   * `tray::build` loads the same id through `Icon::from_resource`, which lets
//     Windows pick the entry matching the notification area's icon size instead
//     of rescaling a single bitmap.
//
// Keep the icon multi-resolution (16/20/24/32/48/64/128/256) so that choice has
// something to pick from at every DPI scaling factor.
1 ICON "rustclipsync.ico"
